    "detailed_description": "<h1>Follow the development</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wishlist so you don't miss the launch discount!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339590/extras/25a58481da79dd86c8ff674ba875f797.poster.avif?t=1691098733\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339590/extras/25a58481da79dd86c8ff674ba875f797.webm?t=1691098733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339590/extras/25a58481da79dd86c8ff674ba875f797.mp4?t=1691098733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interact with moving paintings</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339590/extras/532bad1874704578d5bf7b4186db4759.poster.avif?t=1691098733\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339590/extras/532bad1874704578d5bf7b4186db4759.webm?t=1691098733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339590/extras/532bad1874704578d5bf7b4186db4759.mp4?t=1691098733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Theses paintings animate when you touch them.<br>Meet strange characters, look for clues, and unravel mysteries.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Draw symbols to solve puzzles</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339590/extras/403dc32a466fba048e054db94dfaa53b.poster.avif?t=1691098733\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339590/extras/403dc32a466fba048e054db94dfaa53b.webm?t=1691098733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339590/extras/403dc32a466fba048e054db94dfaa53b.mp4?t=1691098733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>These symbols will change the painting and sometimes the real world.<br>Experiment with many symbols and see what they do!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a surreal world</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339590/extras/9a2f1446972623487ea3e7538080b2a2.poster.avif?t=1691098733\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339590/extras/9a2f1446972623487ea3e7538080b2a2.webm?t=1691098733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339590/extras/9a2f1446972623487ea3e7538080b2a2.mp4?t=1691098733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore a surreal world where the laws of logic do not always apply.<br>Discover places influenced by the art of a painter and add your own touch to it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover the value of art through the story of a painter</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339590/extras/ba2cd537e655f0dd5a0ee71f611cef07.poster.avif?t=1691098733\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339590/extras/ba2cd537e655f0dd5a0ee71f611cef07.webm?t=1691098733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339590/extras/ba2cd537e655f0dd5a0ee71f611cef07.mp4?t=1691098733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Uncover the profound value of art as you delve into the story of a deceased painter.<br>Through your journey, you will gain insights into the power of artistic expression and its impact on the world around us.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wishlist so you don't miss the launch discount!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339590/extras/25a58481da79dd86c8ff674ba875f797.poster.avif?t=1691098733\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339590/extras/25a58481da79dd86c8ff674ba875f797.webm?t=1691098733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339590/extras/25a58481da79dd86c8ff674ba875f797.mp4?t=1691098733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interact with moving paintings</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339590/extras/532bad1874704578d5bf7b4186db4759.poster.avif?t=1691098733\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339590/extras/532bad1874704578d5bf7b4186db4759.webm?t=1691098733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339590/extras/532bad1874704578d5bf7b4186db4759.mp4?t=1691098733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Theses paintings animate when you touch them.<br>Meet strange characters, look for clues, and unravel mysteries.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Draw symbols to solve puzzles</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339590/extras/403dc32a466fba048e054db94dfaa53b.poster.avif?t=1691098733\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339590/extras/403dc32a466fba048e054db94dfaa53b.webm?t=1691098733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339590/extras/403dc32a466fba048e054db94dfaa53b.mp4?t=1691098733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>These symbols will change the painting and sometimes the real world.<br>Experiment with many symbols and see what they do!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a surreal world</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339590/extras/9a2f1446972623487ea3e7538080b2a2.poster.avif?t=1691098733\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339590/extras/9a2f1446972623487ea3e7538080b2a2.webm?t=1691098733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339590/extras/9a2f1446972623487ea3e7538080b2a2.mp4?t=1691098733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore a surreal world where the laws of logic do not always apply.<br>Discover places influenced by the art of a painter and add your own touch to it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover the value of art through the story of a painter</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339590/extras/ba2cd537e655f0dd5a0ee71f611cef07.poster.avif?t=1691098733\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339590/extras/ba2cd537e655f0dd5a0ee71f611cef07.webm?t=1691098733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2339590/extras/ba2cd537e655f0dd5a0ee71f611cef07.mp4?t=1691098733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Uncover the profound value of art as you delve into the story of a deceased painter.<br>Through your journey, you will gain insights into the power of artistic expression and its impact on the world around us.",
